WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.133
Okay,

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:09.733
a picture puzzle!

00:00:09.733 --> 00:00:12.900
Where does the dot move next?

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:13.433
A.

00:00:13.433 --> 00:00:13.967
Top-left,

00:00:13.967 --> 00:00:14.500
B.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Bottom-right,

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:15.533
C.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:16.067
Center,

00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:17.133
or D.

00:00:17.133 --> 00:00:17.667
Bottom-left?

00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:18.733
Five seconds!

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.700
TIME'S UP!

00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:27.900
The answer is...

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:28.400
B,

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:28.900
bottom-right!

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.433
The dot steps clockwise corner

00:00:31.433 --> 00:00:32.433
to corner:

00:00:32.433 --> 00:00:32.967
bottom-left,

00:00:32.967 --> 00:00:33.467
top-left,

00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:33.967
top-right,

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:37.000
so the next corner is bottom-right.

00:00:38.167 --> 00:00:38.567
So,

00:00:38.567 --> 00:00:40.600
are you smart or fart?

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.033
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:43.033 --> 00:00:44.233
find your rank!

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:45.733
So,

00:00:45.733 --> 00:00:47.133
how did you do?

00:00:47.133 --> 00:00:48.500
Comment your score below,

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:49.867
and follow for more!
